    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="0aceaa20-6949-51c5-8054-741f786ca951" activityNameId="4ad5a205-9600-5464-a889-4087ffa38469" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Dismantling, IT accessoires, mechanically, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Dismantling, IT accessoires, mechanically, at plant
manual dismantling plus subsequent shredding/separation procedure, based on common transfer coefficients for both steps. Data from literature and from own experiences in Switzerland. It is assumed that the transfer coefficients data are kept the same. The pedigree matrix for uncertainties are nevertheless adapted for the year 2023; UUID: 44164692-11a5-427f-8dbb-2f7695294930
This dataset represents the mechanical treatment of a WEEE devices in Switzerland. Two process steps are included: manual depollution and the mechanical treatment (shredder) of the remaining part.
Location: European data, used as average for global situation
Technology: 4-step-procedure (shredder - separation - shredder - separation) as used currently often in Europe
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unkonwn
Sampling: literature and own experiences
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_44164692-11a5-427f-8dbb-2f7695294930.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
